      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The hadrosaurid Strides twice. It has a +20-foot circumstance bonus to its Speed during these Strides.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
